<p> Net Income as Reported	    0.69	    0.53</p>
<p> Tax Benefit			 (0.19)	  (0.10)</p>
<p>Net Income Excluding</p>
<p> Tax Benefit			   0.50	    0.43	 16%</p>
<p>NOTE:  The tax benefit is due to a reduction in the company's deferred tax asset valuation allowance.</p>
</text>
